2:T6d4,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you post for us, or just create the content?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our core service is creating finished, approval-ready content: graphics, video, and captions, organized so your team can schedule a week of posts in minutes. If you'd rather hand off scheduling entirely, ask about it during your trial and we'll scope it for your setup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do we need new photography first?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. We build from what you already have: property photography, past campaign material, menus, event details, even good phone photos. If your library is genuinely thin in one area, we'll tell you honestly and work with what performs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you match our brand standards?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, that's table stakes. We work from your brand files and, for flag properties, with brand-standard awareness built in. Assets are built to pass your review (and your brand's) the first time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How fast do we get content each month?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Delivery runs on a steady cadence through the month rather than one big drop, and the first batch from the free trial arrives within 7 days. Time-sensitive event or promo assets get prioritized around your calendar."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What if we have multiple properties?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Multi-property groups are the core of what we do: group-level brand consistency with property-level customization, on one plan and one invoice. Groups of 5+ properties get a custom-scoped partnership."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"fraunces_d33d7a44-module__zs38na__variable allura_9bd08e98-module__XFiXaq__variable archer-luxury min-h-screen bg-[#050505] text-[#F6F1E7]","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":